  {
    "seq": 10,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": "**Offset-addressed streaming** is a distributed data processing paradigm where events are sequentially appended to an immutable, partitioned commit",
      "offset": 0,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 11,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": " log and assigned monotonically increasing numerical identifiers known as offsets. Rather than relying on a broker to track message delivery states and consume",
      "offset": 147,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 12,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": "-and-delete queues, each record's physical position is addressable by its unique offset within a partition. Consumers",
      "offset": 306,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 13,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": " track their own read progress by persisting their current offset position, effectively decoupling consumers from both producers and one another. This design",
      "offset": 423,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 14,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": " allows multiple distinct systems to read the identical stream concurrently at independent processing speeds without degrading throughput or mutating the underlying data. Because",
      "offset": 580,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 15,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": " streams are retained based on configured time or size policies rather than consumption acknowledgments, consumers gain deterministic replayability—enabling them to rewind to",
      "offset": 758,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "seq": 16,
    "type": "text.delta",
    "payload": {
      "text": " historical offsets for fault tolerance, state reconstruction, auditing, or backfilling newly deployed analytical pipelines.",
      "offset": 932,
      "part_id": "msg-571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac-0",
      "step_id": "571802dc-3d72-5041-b115-b32bdd9538ac"
    }
  },
  {
